    <briefdescription>
<para>Weekends-only calendar. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This calendar has no bank holidays except for weekends (Saturdays and Sundays) as required by ISDA for calculating conventional CDS spreads. </para>    </detaileddescription>
